<title>FRANCE: Moroccan buyers buy 15,000 T French wheat - trade.</title>
<headline>Moroccan buyers buy 15,000 T French wheat - trade.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Private Moroccan importers on Thursday bought 15,000 tonnes of French soft wheat at $161.50 per tonne, including cost and freight, European grain traders said.</p>
<p>The wheat, for delivery between February 25 and March 5, will be paid for in cash, they said.</p>
<p>Subtracting freight and other costs, the deal values February wheat with a protein content of 11.5 percent and a moisture level of 13 percent at $146.50 per tonne fob France.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
</text>
